  <div class="container-narrow prose fade-in">
    <p>Veterans deserve dental care that is accessible, compassionate, and focused on their unique needs. Too often, obtaining quality dental treatment can be frustrating and difficult. We believe Veterans deserve better.</p>

    <h2>Care from a fellow Veteran</h2>
    <p>Dr. Matthew Phillips is proud to continue serving Veterans after his military career. Having served as an Army dentist for 10 years, he understands firsthand the sacrifices, challenges, and values shared by those who have worn the uniform.</p>

    <h2>Our mission is simple</h2>
    <p>Provide the care Veterans deserve. We take the time to listen, explain treatment options, and deliver exceptional dentistry with honesty, respect, and excellence.</p>

    <h2>Dental care veterans often need</h2>
    <p>Many veterans come to us after years of putting their own dental care last, or after leaving military dental coverage behind. Whatever shape your teeth are in, we start with a judgment-free exam and a clear plan. Dr. Phillips provides most treatment himself in our Tempe office, including:</p>
    <ul class="checklist">
      <li><a href="/services/preventive-care/">Cleanings, exams and X-rays</a> to get you back on a regular schedule</li>
      <li><a href="/services/dental-fillings/">Fillings</a> and <a href="/services/crowns-bridges/">crowns</a> for cracked, worn or decayed teeth</li>
      <li><a href="/services/tooth-extractions/">Extractions</a>, including same-day extractions when a tooth can't be saved</li>
      <li><a href="/services/dental-implants/">Dental implants</a>, <a href="/services/dentures/">dentures</a> and <a href="/services/all-on-4/">All-on-4</a> to replace missing teeth</li>
      <li><a href="/services/tmj-night-guards/">Night guards</a> for clenching and grinding</li>
      <li><a href="/services/sedation-dentistry/">Sedation</a> if dental visits are hard for you</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>A calm, respectful visit</h2>
    <p>If loud environments, being reclined, or a past dental experience make visits difficult, tell us. We can explain each step before we do it, take breaks when you need them, and talk about sedation options. You set the pace.</p>

    <h2>No dental insurance? Start here</h2>
    <p>Most veterans don't have dental coverage through the VA. If you're paying out of pocket, start with our <a href="/special-offers/">$49 new-patient exam and X-rays</a>, and ask about our additional veteran discount when you call. We give you a written estimate before any treatment, and Cherry financing and in-house payment plans are available. See <a href="/insurance-financing/">insurance and financing</a>.</p>

    <h2>Visit our veteran-owned practice in Tempe</h2>
    <p>We're at {{ site.address.full }}, open {{ site.hours.display }}, and we welcome veterans and their families from Tempe, Mesa, Chandler, Gilbert, Scottsdale and across the East Valley. Call <a href="tel:{{ site.phone.telShort }}" data-action="call-veterans">{{ site.phone.display }}</a> and let us know you served.</p>

